@startuml sequence_mode_switch
!theme plain
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

title Mode Switch - Layouts Stay Isolated

actor User
participant DashboardModeService as Mode
participant DashboardLayoutService as L
participant DashboardShellComponent as Shell
participant Gridster

User -> Mode: setMode('review')
Mode --> L: signal change
L -> L: currentLayout = reviewLayout
Shell -> L: currentLayout()
L --> Shell: reviewLayout snapshot
Shell -> Gridster: re-bind items
Gridster -> Gridster: destroy live tiles, mount review tiles

note right of L
  liveLayout signal\nis untouched.
end note

@enduml
